OL,3,GNEWSAPatients praise NHS diagnostic
OL,4,Acentre expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients have welcomed the opening of
OL,7,Fnew facilities at an NHS diagnostic
OL,8,Fcentre in Derbyshire.
OL,10,FThe unit at Walton Hospital in
OL,11,FChesterfield now offers MRI and CT
OL,12,Fscans and avoids the need for patients
OL,13,Fto visit larger hospitals, some of
OL,14,Fwhich have limited parking.
OL,16,FThe #7.5m expansion of the centre took
OL,17,Fjust 10 months and features modular
OL,18,Fbuildings which were lifted in place by
OL,19,Fcranes.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
