OL,3,GNEWSAPatients praise NHS diagnostic
OL,4,Acentre expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was opened on Tuesday by James Frith
OL,7,FMP, Minister for Health Innovation, who
OL,8,Fsaid it was part of the government's
OL,9,Fdrive to take NHS hospital care into
OL,10,Fthe community and that the centre will
OL,11,Foperate seven days a week.
